{"final":{"answer":"The net change in Entergy Mississippi, Inc. net revenue from 2002 to 2003 was an increase of $46.4 million.","value":46.4,"unit":"USD_million","sources":["source:t1c1n0","source:t4c1n0"],"result_id":"tool:1","explanation":"Net revenue is Entergy Mississippi's measure of gross margin. Using the two comparison endpoints in the table: 2003 net revenue of $426.6 million (source:t4c1n0) minus 2002 net revenue of $380.2 million (source:t1c1n0) = $46.4 million increase. This is consistent with the table's components (base rates +48.3, other -1.9)."}}